# Adaptation: documentation instruction

Use for the project's practical knowledge-maintenance route, not a new CMS.
Copy only payload; fill agent `{{fields}}`, remove irrelevant sections and recompute
all links from its actual output path. Default output: `docs/instructions/documentation.md`.
Required metadata/types: [single schema](../../references/metadata.md).
Foundations/procedures: [lifecycle](../../references/lifecycle.md).
Essential: when, scope, owner-selection/update path, constraints, checks and update
triggers. Optional: diagrams/assets/views when absent from the project. Existing
native instructions/local decisions prevail; do not replace them with boilerplate.

